title: "trida-stack"
abstract: >-
  Training and serving stack for Trillion Labs' Trida two-stream block-diffusion
  language models (Qwen3 / Qwen3.5-based): AR-to-diffusion SFT training and
  block-diffusion / self-speculative decoding with SGLang and vLLM backends.
